/*
 * Implements semantic validation and construction of the class vtable.
 *
 * This module orchestrates the full method-validation pipeline:
 *
 *   1. Retrieve ancestor vtable entries.
 *   2. Retrieve trait-implementation methods.
 *   3. Validate methods declared directly in the class.
 *   4. Validate methods declared inside trait implementations.
 *   5. Enforce override rules and detect collisions.
 *   6. Enforce abstract-method completeness.
 *   7. Install the final vtable into the ClassRefType.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::method
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/method.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-29
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
